# Protocol v0, text layer: replies, errors, clipping, scaling, screens.
# Run: build/hp41-gfx --script tests/gfx/v0.gfx
GI
?
!reply 0 480 320 16 256 B4096
?E
!reply 0

# pixel write and read, bounds
W 10 20 5
!pixel 0 10 20 5
R 10 20
!reply 5
R 479 319
!reply 0
R 480 0
!err 5
?E
!reply E 5 OUTSIDE
?E
!reply 0
W 0 0 256
!err 4
W 0 0 1.5
!err 4
X 1 2
!err 1
ABC
!err 1
M 1
!err 2
M 1 x
!err 3
M 1 2 3 4 5 6
!err 2
?E
!reply E 2 ARG COUNT

# lines, pen colour, clipping at the edge
K 3;M 0 0;D 9 0
!err 0
!pixel 0 0 0 3
!pixel 0 9 0 3
!pixel 0 10 0 0
K 4;M 100 100;D 110 110
!pixel 0 105 105 4
!pixel 0 105 106 0
K 6;M 470 300;D 470 400
!pixel 0 470 319 6
K 2;M -5 50;D 5 50
!pixel 0 0 50 2
!pixel 0 5 50 2
P 7 7
!pixel 0 7 7 2

# ARCL digit grouping: commas are ignored, so 1,0 is 10
W 1,0 30 7
!pixel 0 10 30 7

# drawing target versus shown screen
T 1;C 2;S 1
!pixel 1 0 0 2
!pixel 1 300 300 2
!pixel 0 0 0 3
R 0 0
!reply 2
T 16
!err 4
S 15
!err 0
T 15;W 1 1 9
!pixel 15 1 1 9
!pixel 0 1 1 0

# an error stops the rest of the line; earlier commands stand
T 0;W 200 201 8;X;W 200 200 9
!err 1
!pixel 0 200 201 8
!pixel 0 200 200 0

# scaled user units, y up
GI
SC -10 10 -10 10
P 0 0
!pixel 0 240 160 1
P -10 10
!pixel 0 0 0 1
P 10 -10
!pixel 0 479 319 1
SC 1 1 0 1
!err 7
SP;P 5 5
!pixel 0 5 5 1

# empty commands are allowed
;;
!err 0

# GI resets everything, including other screens
T 3;C 9;GI
!pixel 3 0 0 0
!pixel 0 5 5 0
GI
W 1 1 5:W 2 2 6
!pixel 0 1 1 5
!pixel 0 2 2 6

# SX and SY: SC in two halves
GI
SX -10 10
SY -10 10
P 0 0
!pixel 0 240 160 1
SX 5 5
!err 7
